Package: emhawkes
Title: Exponential Multivariate Hawkes Model
Version: 0.9.9
Authors@R: person("Kyungsub", "Lee", email = "kyungsub@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Kyungsub Lee <kyungsub@gmail.com>
Description: Simulate and fit multivariate Hawkes models with exponential
    kernels, introduced by Hawkes (1971) <doi:10.2307/2334319>.
    Includes marked, state-dependent, and multi-kernel specifications.
    Parameter estimation uses maximum likelihood, following Ozaki (1979)
    <doi:10.1007/BF02480272>, through the 'maxLik' package.
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
